# Normalise to LF everywhere. The repo previously mixed CRLF (root .py) with LF
# (the vendored SpCL tree), which made every cross-tree diff unreadable: comparing
# utils.py against its SpCL twin reported 3,374 differing lines when the true figure
# was 134. See Todo.md C5.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Results and arrays are stored byte-exact: no line-ending conversion, no diffing.
# (The rules above are for code; `* text=auto eol=lf` rewrote CRLF to LF in results.csv
# files and in a CSV whose sha256 a provenance file had recorded.)
*.csv -text
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
